extends base-email

block content
  table(align="center")
    tr
      td(style="padding: 30px;")
        h2(style="color: #000; margin-top: 0;") Thanks for Subscribing!

        p Hi #{name},
        p Thanks for subscribing to our newsletter! You are officially on the inside.

        p We are committed to supporting a community of builders who are doing extraordinary work in the places where it matters most, and we’re glad to have you join us.

        p As a member of our email community, you'll be the first to hear about our latest news, exclusive offers, and helpful tips. Expect purpose, energy, connection, and a few surprises.

        p In the meantime, feel free to:
        ul(style="padding-left: 20px; line-height: 1.6;")
          li
            | Connect with us on social media:
            a(href="http://facebook.com/Ennovatelab") Facebook
            |  |
            a(href="https://www.instagram.com/official_ennovatelab") Instagram
            |  |
            a(href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/ennovatelab") LinkedIn
            |  |
            a(href="https://x.com/ennovatelab") X
          li
            | Explore our online store →
            a(href="https://www.ennovatelab.com/stores") eLab Store
          li
            | Read the latest from eLab from
            a(href="https://www.ennovatelab.com/libraries") here

        p The future needs people like you.

        p
          strong The Ennovate Lab Team
          br
          | We transform underserved communities through technology, entrepreneurship & placemaking.

        p
          | Explore our work: 
          a(href="https://www.ennovatelab.com") www.ennovatelab.com
